# TRMNLP configuration - sample community goal
# Copy this file to .trmnlp.yml (which is git-ignored) to use it with `trmnlp serve`.
# Removing the `activeInitiatives` override makes the preview use the live API instead.
# {{ env.VARIABLE }} interpolation is available here
---
# auto-reload when files change (`watch: false` to disable)
watch:
  - .trmnlp.yml
  - src

# values of custom fields (defined in src/settings.yml)
custom_fields: {}

# override variables
variables:
  trmnl: {}
  activeInitiatives:
    - id: "861"
      title: "Brewer Corporation Jump Satellite Initiative"
      expiry: "2026-10-15 10:00:00"
      market_name: "Zero Squared"
      starsystem_name: "HIP 74116"
      activityType: "tradelist"
      target_commodity_list: "Semiconductors, Superconductors, Power Generators, Computer Components"
      target_qty: "200000000"
      qty: "200000158"
      objective: "Semiconductors, Superconductors, Power Generators, Computer Components"
      images: "NewsImageMarket"
      bulletin: |
        Brewer Corporation has issued a call for assistance to aid in the manufacturing of what it calls 'jump satellites'.

        Independent pilots have been asked to supply computer components, superconductors, semiconductors and power generators.

        Pilots can support this initiative by first signing up at the megaship Zero Squared in the HIP 74116 system, before supplying the required commodities.

        Pilots who supply at least 1 commodity will receive the following rewards:

        - The top 75% contributors will receive 1 x Size 4 and 1 x Size 5 SCO-enabled FSD, pre-engineered with Increased Range and Fast Boot Sequence and unlocked experimentals.
        - The top 50% contributors will also receive 1 x Size 6 and 1 x Size 7 SCO-enabled FSD, pre-engineered with Increased Range and Fast Boot Sequence and unlocked experimentals.
        - Credits, depending on success tier achieved and individual contribution level.

        The campaign will run for one week. If the final target is met earlier than planned, the campaign will end immediately.
